  m_text: '1.<indent=8%><b>The "Repeating Portraits" in the Main Gallery</b>

    <i>Past
    visitors have remarked that the portraits appear endlessly duplicated.</i>

    This
    is intentional. The Collector, paranoid of trespassers, commissioned identical
    replicas to conceal what is valuable.</indent>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
